	(gr_text "Drawn as the centre face of RB_Box_WS8inch_v3.dxf, 191.6 x 116.3 mm between the bend lines.\nThe board keeps 2.8 mm from each side for the sheet thickness, which the DXF does not state.\nNo mounting holes: the box has no bosses. Mount the board on the display's standoffs or add rivet\nnuts.\nThe connector cut-outs are not drawn: in the v3 DXF the vent grid and a fitting fall outside the\nsheet outline, so their positions need checking with the designer first."
